  },
  "description": "RL routing distribution and effectiveness. Every NGINX request lands in the metrics hypertable tagged with $upstream_addr — so the per-backend request share over time is a direct reflection of how lb-sidecar's weighted upstream block is steering traffic. When PPO is active and the argmax-dominant weighting (chosen=0.7, floor=0.075 per v1.0.7) lands, you see one slice jump to ~70%. The latency + error panels show whether the dominant choice is actually the best one.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource", "uid": "timescaledb"},
      "description": "Share of requests handled by each backend over time. With weight=70:8:8:8:8 (v1.0.7 argmax-dominant) one backend takes ~70% of the area; with classical round-robin all backends are ~20%. Stack normalises to 100%.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "share",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "hideFrom": {"legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false},
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {"type": "linear"},
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "percent"},
            "thresholdsStyle": {"mode": "off"}
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}]},
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "legend": {"calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "title": "Request share per backend",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "WITH bucketed AS (\n  SELECT time_bucket('$__interval', time) AS bucket,\n         instance,\n         SUM(value) AS cnt\n  FROM metrics\n  WHERE $__timeFilter(time)\n    AND service = 'load-balancer'\n    AND metric_name = 'request_count'\n  GROUP BY 1, 2\n),\ntotals AS (\n  SELECT bucket, SUM(cnt) AS total FROM bucketed GROUP BY bucket\n)\nSELECT b.bucket AS \"time\",\n       b.instance AS metric,\n       b.cnt::float / NULLIF(t.total, 0) AS value\nFROM bucketed b\nJOIN totals t USING (bucket)\nORDER BY 1",
          "datasource": {"type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource", "uid": "timescaledb"}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource", "uid": "timescaledb"},
      "description": "p95 latency observed by NGINX per backend. The line for the RL-chosen backend should sit at or below the others — if PPO is consistently picking the slowest backend, the routing is fighting the operator's intent.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "ms",
